#33164
Before the Alpine Inn~
Old runoff has traced narrow stains down the building's lower walls.
Underfoot, the approach is scuffed pale where people stop before moving on.
Grit gathers close to the foundation, and the surrounding structure gives this
small patch of ground a little shelter from the wider world.`x
