#33165
The Town Hall~
The near ceiling steps down above a squared structural pier faced in brushed
steel. A narrow patch in the flooring crosses the usual line of travel at a
diagonal. The enclosure makes a small sound feel near even when the source
lies beyond the immediate view.`x
